  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Star Snail Hall is the corpse of a star sea snail. The first generation Combat Beast King was the strongest Combat Beast Warrior in history, yet killing the star sea snail cost his life. The current Combat Beast King later merges with the star sea snail’s shell to transport Combat Beast Warriors into battle.",
      "chapters": [
        1688
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_combat_beast_king"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Deviation (recorded): this page is filed under gu-houses because Star Snail Hall is a named Gu House. It is Beast Calamity grotto-heaven and later sovereign-aperture equipment tied to Star Collection City, not a five-region map seat.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_house",
        "loc_beast_calamity_grotto_heaven",
        "loc_star_collection_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The hall is the corpse of the star sea snail; the shell itself is the structure Combat Beast King merges with and shakes when transporting warriors.",
      "chapters": [
        1688
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At a critical moment Star Snail Hall surges with blinding starlight, and a giant appears on the battlefield. That giant is the current generation Combat Beast King transforming with the corpse of the Star Sea Snail, the highest battle strength in Beast Calamity grotto-heaven and the final trump card. Zhan Bu Du later flies to the underground of Star Snail Hall and reaches the last altar of the Beast Calamity true inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        1917
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battlefield-trump-card",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "res_star_sea_snail_shell",
        "char_zhan_bu_du",
        "inh_beast_calamity_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the center of Star Collection City, after the city is moved into Mini Blue Heaven, there is already a brand new Star Snail Hall, a mortal Gu House Fang Yuan purposely builds. The Star Sea Snail that originally served as the hall is put into his treasury as an immemorial desolate beast whose shell is a rank eight immortal material.",
      "chapters": [
        1919
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rebuilt-mortal-gu-house",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_mini_blue_heaven",
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    }
  ],
